; M1918A2 Browning Automatic Rifle, assembled from primitives.
; Local space matches the other weapons: barrel fires along -Z, +Y up. Roughly
; life-size (~1.19m long).
;
; Heavy squad automatic: long barrel, twenty-round box under the receiver and a
; bipod at the muzzle. Uses the base magazine reload, so the box hangs off a
; node named Magazine and the charging handle off one named BoltHandle.
